OL,3,GNEWSARace against time for man to buy
OL,4,Anew wheelchair
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with a rare, life-limiting
OL,7,Fcondition has just three months to
OL,8,Fraise the money he needs for a new
OL,9,Fwheelchair.
OL,11,FCorey Haseley, from Telford, has Optic
OL,12,FAtrophy Plus Syndrome Mitochondrial
OL,13,FDisease OPA1 and was not expected to
OL,14,Flive beyond the age of 19.
OL,16,FIt's a condition which has left him
OL,17,Fblind and suffering from fatigue,
OL,18,Fmuscle spasms, epilepsy and needing
OL,19,Fmedication for pain.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
