OL,3,GNEWSARace against time for man to buy
OL,4,Anew wheelchair
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow 31, he said his current wheelchair
OL,7,Fis no longer suitable for his needs.
OL,8,FDespite his troubles, he said: "I was
OL,9,Fbrought up to believe the sky's the
OL,10,Flimit and if I want to do something, I
OL,11,Fwill".
